This licence covers only the code written for this project:

  src/common/
  src/D2OpenGL/dllmain.c
  src/D2OpenGL/launch.c
  src/D2OpenGL/install/
  src/D2OpenGL/host/
  src/D2OpenGL/renderer/slots.cpp
  Makefile, .github/

The rest of src/D2OpenGL/renderer/ is recovered from Blizzard Entertainment's Diablo II 1.14d for Mac and
is not licensed by this project. Neither is src/D2OpenGL/platform/: it replaces the Mac platform code with
Windows calls but keeps the structure and logic of the recovered functions.

Diablo is a trademark of Blizzard Entertainment, Inc.

